  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Skills for Oil and Gas Africa Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Skills for Oil and Gas Africa Programme is a component of Employment and Skills for Eastern Africa: E4D/SOGA reported by FCDO with a funding type of 112 - Other bilateral donor and a budget of &#xA3;13,125,116. This project benefits Eastern Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Mineral/mining policy and administrative management, Vocational training, Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Public sector policy and administrative management, Teacher training.</narrative>
  </description>
